{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAUST DUEL</strong> is a roguelike deck-builder built on the rules of Blackjack.<br>Every <strong>Hit/Stand</strong> is a wager between greed and restraint. Bend the odds with <strong>special card faces</strong> and <strong>trinket synergies</strong>, outplay opponents with unique rules, and clear one table after another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Glimpse of Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic deck, earn chips and rewards, then <strong>modify cards</strong> and <strong>buy trinkets</strong> to shape your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with distinct quirks; play your hand and <strong>beat their total without busting</strong> to win the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No good options? Strike a <strong>Faustian deal</strong>\u2014draw a card and gain power <strong>at the cost of Sin and Punishments</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resist temptation: <strong>defeat all foes to gain Faith</strong> and claim powerful <strong>Blessings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure isn\u2019t the end\u2014learn, unlock, and <strong>sit back down for another run</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 special card faces</strong> \u2013 rule-bending mechanics that can reshape how you count, combine, and protect your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/1fb239465729ff3fbd3fa8171d0ff2d8.avif?t=1757986746\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ trinkets</strong> \u2013 unique effects to handle different enemies and table conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/7f36e0b8590f89bd88e2be1a07e3fe63.avif?t=1757986746\" width=576 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 +enemies</strong> \u2013 each with its own passives, bans, and play rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/666ee4223d9f1e9b980b19b43fbcbe74.avif?t=1757986746\" width=576 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>22 Blessings &amp; Curses</strong> \u2013 victories grant lasting Blessings; defeat or demonic bargains burden you with Curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/0520188348758bb12b41f88a472d6b73.avif?t=1757986746\" width=576 height=96 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulties + Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 go from approachable to extreme; chase longer streaks in Endless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Challenges</strong> \u2013 curated constraints that force fresh lines of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918360/extras/800fbaa1b242ac2caeb5ebb2e640d021.avif?t=1757986746\" width=448 height=64 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy rounds</strong> and a strong \u201cjust one more hand\u201d loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildcraft \u00d7 probability</strong>: every Hit matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical decisions with <strong>punchy payoffs</strong> at the table.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Single-player only. No real-money gambling 